'''Soldier Scarabs''' are a monster that is summoned by [[Kephri]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They use melee attacks.

If Kephri's shield/health is depleted, the scarab will occasionally send out an unattackable scarab swarm to recharge her shield or restore her health respectively. The amount restored scales to the scarab's health.

